  <div class="mkt-hero">
    <span class="hero-accent on-dark hha-fade" style="--d:0ms" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <h1><span class="hha-line" style="--d:160ms"><span class="hha-in">Experience built across</span><span class="hha-edge" aria-hidden="true"></span></span><span class="hha-line" style="--d:940ms"><span class="hha-in">diverse markets</span><span class="hha-edge" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></h1>
    <p class="lede hha-fade" style="--d:1720ms">The Hana group covers the full breadth of EMS services, from automotive qualified production and medical grade assembly to high-volume RFID inlays, complex PCBA and sensor packaging.</p>
    <p class="lede hha-fade" style="--d:1860ms">This diversity strengthens our manufacturing capability and shared quality standards across all sectors. Experience gained across different products, volumes and technical requirements informs how we push towards innovative new processes, apply automation and support customer programs. It also gives Hana a balanced customer and market base, reducing dependence on any single sector.</p>
  </div>
